>
  <div class="eyebrow">About</div>
  <h1>About</h1>

  <p>
    I'm Logan Lyle. My work sits at the intersection of operations, finance, and
    technology — I've spent my career building and running the systems underneath a
    business, not just advising on them from outside.
  </p>
  <p>
    I co-founded and helped scale Wellyfe, a pharmacy benefit management company,
    through to a successful exit in 2026. Since then, I've been consulting on process
    optimization, automation, and healthcare operations
    <span class="needs-input">needs input</span>, and building software and automation
    systems for my own use — including Simon, a personal chief-of-staff system I
    designed to handle the operational load of running several things at once.
  </p>
  <p>
    I like problems where the constraint is real — a regulatory requirement, a finance
    close, a process that has to survive contact with actual humans — and I'd rather
    build the tool than write the memo about the tool.
  </p>
